               </ul>
            </li>
         
            <li class="cmp-exe-order-feed__item">
               <div class="title">
                  <div class="cmp-title">
                     <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Executive Order 2023-04</h3>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <p>Establishes the Children’s Behavioral Health Transformation Initiative Chief position. This position shall lead the State’s comprehensive, inter-agency effort to ensure that youth with significant and complex behavioral health needs receive appropriate community and residential services and that the State-supported system is transparent and easier for youth and their families to navigate.</p>
               <ul> 
                  <li>
                  <a href="/government/executive-orders/executive-order.executive-order-number-04.2023.html" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-04(HTML)">Executive Order 2023-04(HTML)</a>
                  
                  </li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-04.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-04 English">English</a></li>
                  
               </ul>
            </li>
         
            <li class="cmp-exe-order-feed__item">
               <div class="title">
                  <div class="cmp-title">
                     <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Executive Order 2023-03</h3>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <p>Renames the “Illinois Emergency Management Agency” to the  “Illinois Emergency Management Agency and Office of Homeland Security.” Reestablishes all powers and advisory councils previously under the “Illinois Emergency Management Agency” to the “Illinois Emergency Management Agency and Office of Homeland Security.”</p>
               <ul> 
                  <li>
                  <a href="/government/executive-orders/executive-order.executive-order-number-03.2023.html" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03(HTML)">Executive Order 2023-03(HTML)</a>
                  
                  </li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-03.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03 English">English</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-03-arabic.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03 Arabic">Arabic</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-03-polish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03 Polish">Polish</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-03-tagalog.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03 Tagalog">Tagalog</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-03-chinese.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03 Chinese">Chinese</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2023/executive-order-2023-03-spanish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2023-03 Spanish">Spanish</a></li>
                  
