            <li class="cmp-exe-order-feed__item">
               <div class="title">
                  <div class="cmp-title">
                     <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Executive Order 2022-03</h3>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <p>SCHOOL SAFETY – Schools must take specific measures to ensure the safety of students and schools, including investigating the occurrence of cases, close contacts, and symptomatic individuals. All schools shall make remote instruction available. This Executive Order supersedes EO 2021-24 and EO 2021-25.</p>
               <ul> 
                  <li>
                  <a href="/government/executive-orders/executive-order.executive-order-number-03.2022.html" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-03(HTML)">Executive Order 2022-03(HTML)</a>
                  
                  </li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-03.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-03 English">English</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-03-arabic.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-03 Arabic">Arabic</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-03-polish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-03 Polish">Polish</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-03-tagalog.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-03 Tagalog">Tagalog</a></li>
                  
