                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-03-hindi.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-03 Hindi">Hindi</a></li>
                  
               </ul>
            </li>
         
            <li class="cmp-exe-order-feed__item">
               <div class="title">
                  <div class="cmp-title">
                     <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Executive Order 2022-02</h3>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <p>ILLINOIS JOINT ANALYSIS CENTER – Establishes the Illinois Joint Analysis Center, to protect the people of Illinois by providing an information sharing network designed to gather, analyze, and disseminate cyber analysis and information.</p>
               <ul> 
                  <li>
                  <a href="/government/executive-orders/executive-order.executive-order-number-02.2022.html" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02(HTML)">Executive Order 2022-02(HTML)</a>
                  
                  </li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 English">English</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02-arabic.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 Arabic">Arabic</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02-polish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 Polish">Polish</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02-tagalog.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 Tagalog">Tagalog</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02-chinese.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 Chinese">Chinese</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02-spanish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 Spanish">Spanish</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-02-hindi.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-02 Hindi">Hindi</a></li>
                  
               </ul>
            </li>
         
            <li class="cmp-exe-order-feed__item">
               <div class="title">
                  <div class="cmp-title">
                     <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Executive Order 2022-01</h3>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <p>REISSUES EXECUTIVE ORDERS - Reissues several executive orders, extending a majority of the provisions through February 5, 2022.</p>
               <ul> 
                  <li>
                  <a href="/government/executive-orders/executive-order.executive-order-number-01.2022.html" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01(HTML)">Executive Order 2022-01(HTML)</a>
                  
                  </li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 English">English</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01-arabic.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 Arabic">Arabic</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01-polish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 Polish">Polish</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01-tagalog.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 Tagalog">Tagalog</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01-chinese.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 Chinese">Chinese</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01-spanish.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 Spanish">Spanish</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2022/executive-order-2022-01-hindi.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order 2022-01 Hindi">Hindi</a></li>
                  
               </ul>
            </li>
         
      </ul>
      
