                     <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Executive Order Number 05</h3>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <p>REISSUES EXECUTIVE ORDERS - Reissues most executive orders, extending a majority of the provisions through April 3, 2021.</p>
               <ul> 
                  <li>
                  <a href="/government/executive-orders/executive-order.executive-order-number-05.2021.html" aria-label="Executive Order 2021-05(HTML)">Executive Order 2021-05(HTML)</a>
                  
                  </li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2021/executiveorder-2021-05.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order Number 05 English">English</a></li>
                  
                     <li><a href="/content/dam/soi/en/web/illinois/documents/government/executive-orders/2021/executiveorder-2021-05-arabic.pdf" target="_blank" aria-label="Executive Order Number 05 Arabic">Arabic</a></li>
                  
